00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:44,920
Alice Synthesis 30!

262
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:49,640
I am the proxy of the three
goddesses who protect this realm!

263
00:21:50,160 --> 00:21:51,960
I am the Priestess of Light,

264
00:21:52,140 --> 00:21:56,300
and whoever dares defy me shall
know the fury of my power!

265
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:01,430
Alice...

266
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,070
Alicia...

267
00:22:06,620 --> 00:22:11,557
One day, even though I'm just calm.

268
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:15,277
Time to fall down!

269
00:22:15,360 --> 00:22:19,260
A strong heart.

270
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:27,537
Two of them were just so dry.

271
00:22:27,620 --> 00:22:32,057
Thank you so much

272
00:22:32,140 --> 00:22:34,900
for being here.

273
00:22:36,060 --> 00:22:41,060
If you're alone, you'll
be able to live alone.

274
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:46,457
It doesn't matter if
you don't love anyone.

275
00:22:46,540 --> 00:22:50,400
I don't want you to be able to do it.

276
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:57,700
It's your voice, it's your voice.

277
00:23:00,540 --> 00:23:07,240
I don't want you to be able to do it.

278
00:23:08,040 --> 00:23:10,120
It's my dream.
